# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# NO_INDEX FOLDERS - nothing under these is ever tracked
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 01_build_files_no_index/ is the drop zone for any part of the build that
# must not reach the remote: handoffs, build notes, credentials, concept
# art, client paths. A folder named no_index is not indexed; the name is
# the instruction and it is binding on its own.
#
# The whole folder is ignored, including any .gitkeep, so the rule has no
# exceptions and needs no carve-outs. Recreate the folder on a fresh clone.
01_build_files_no_index/
*_no_index/
